#. Tag: title
#: extragear-applications.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; Extragear Applications"
msgstr "កម្មវិធី KDE Extragear"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These are applications that are directly associated with &kde;, the project, "
"but do not appear and are not shipped with the main &kde; distribution. This "
"can be down to a number of reasons, but a common case is either down to a "
"duplication of functionality, or because they're simply too specialised. "
"Perhaps the most popular occurence however is that the developers themselves "
"may not want it to appear in the main &kde; distribution; choosing, rather, to "
"handle their own release schedules. Nevertheless, the applications in Extragear "
"are distinguished by &kde;, and many are increasingly popular."
msgstr ""
"ទាំងនេះ​គឺ​ជា​កម្មវិធី​ដែល​ជាប់​ទាក់ទង​ដោយ​ផ្ទាល់​ជាមួយ KDE គម្រោង "
"ប៉ុន្តែ​មិន​លេចឡើង និង​មិន​ត្រូវ​បាន​ភ្ជាប់​ជាមួយ​ការ​ចែកចាយ KDE មេ ។ នេះ​អាច​គាំង​ដោយ​មូលហេតុ​មួយ​ចំនួន ប៉ុន្តែ​ករណី​ទូទៅ​គឺ​គាំង​ដោយ​មុខងារ​ផ្ទួន ឬ​ពីព្រោះ​ជា​ធម្មតា​ពួក​វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ពិសេស​ពេក ។ "
"ប្រហែល​ជា​ការ​កើត​ឡើង​ពេញ​និយម​បំផុត ទោះ​យ៉ាង​ណា គឺ​ថា អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍​ខ្លួន​គេ​នឹង​មិន​ចង់​ឲ្យ​វា​លេចឡើង​ក្នុង​ការ​ចែកចាយ KDE មេ​ទេ ជ្រើស​ជាជាង​គ្រប់គ្រង​កាល​វិភាគ​ចេញផ្សាយ​ផ្ទាល់​របស់​ពួក​គេ ។ យ៉ាង​ណា​ក៏​ដោយ កម្មវិធី​ក្នុង Extragear "
"ត្រូវ​បាន​សម្គាល់​ដោយ KDE និង​​កម្មវិធី​ជា​ច្រើន​បាន​បង្កើត​ការ​ពេញ​និយម ។"

#. Tag: title
#: extragear-applications.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Available in the &kde; Extragear"
msgstr "មាន​នៅ​ក្នុង KDE Extragear"

#. Tag: title
#: extragear-applications.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multimedia"
msgstr "ពហុ​ព័ត៌មាន"

#. Tag: term
#: extragear-applications.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amarok;"
msgstr "Amarok"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An advanced and comprehensive music player with the capability to play <acronym>"
"MP3</acronym>, <acronym>WAV</acronym>, and <acronym>OGG</acronym> "
"audio filetypes and others. There is not room here to mention all of &amarok;'s "
"features, but by default, &amarok; can automatically fetch cover art, embed "
"song lyrics, and display aesthetically pleasing visualizations. &amarok; "
"remains, as much of &kde; does, highly customizable; it contains a powerful "
"scripting interface, and the context browser can be stylised easily using "
"&CSS;. &amarok; also supports several backends, including <application>"
"GStreamer</application>, <application>xine</application>, <acronym>NMM</acronym>"
", <acronym>MAS</acronym>, <application>aKode</application> and &arts;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Website: <ulink url=\"http://amarok.kde.org\">http://amarok.kde.org</ulink>"
msgstr "តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://amarok.kde.org\">http://amarok.kde.org</ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"View the handbook by typing <userinput>help:/amarok</userinput> "
"in &konqueror;'s Location Toolbar, or by selecting it in &khelpcenter;; if you "
"do not already have &amarok; installed (and hence do not have the handbook), "
"then you can view it online <ulink "
"url=\"http://amarok.kde.org/component/option,com_staticxt/staticfile,"
"index.html/Itemid,49/\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>K3b</application>"
msgstr "<application>K3b</application>"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The definitive &CD;/<acronym>DVD</acronym> burning application for &kde;. With "
"<application>K3b</application> you can create data, video, and audio (it comes "
"with plugins for <acronym>WAV</acronym>, <acronym>MP3</acronym>, <acronym>"
"FLAC</acronym>, and <application>Ogg Vorbis</application>"
") &CD;s. Projects can be saved and loaded, &CD;-ripping is supported, and you "
"can appropriately make &CD;/<acronym>DVD</acronym> copies."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Extragear Summary: <ulink url=\"http://extragear.kde.org/apps/k3b/\">"
"http://extragear.kde.org/apps/k3b/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"សង្ខេប Extragear ៖ <ulink url=\"http://extragear.kde.org/apps/k3b/\">"
"http://extragear.kde.org/apps/k3b/</ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Website: <ulink url=\"http://k3b.org\">http://k3b.org</ulink>"
msgstr "តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://k3b.org\">http://k3b.org</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>K3b</application> Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ <application>K3b</application>"

#. Tag: title
#: extragear-applications.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "ក្រាហ្វិក"

#. Tag: term
#: extragear-applications.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "&digikam;"
msgstr "Digikam"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A photo management application which can conveniently organize and import "
"digital photos. Features include complete tagging functionality, a plugin "
"system, and a fully-featured comment system. &digikam; also makes use of "
"<acronym>KIPI</acronym> (&kde; Image Plugin Interface), therefore contributing "
"to the initiative to create a common plugin infrastructure, which allows "
"development of image plugins that can be shared among graphical applications in "
"&kde; (others include <application>Gwenview</application>, <application>"
"ShowImg</application> and <application>KimDaBa</application>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "Website: <ulink url=\"http://digikam.org\">http://digikam.org</ulink>"
msgstr "តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://digikam.org\">http://digikam.org</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "&digikam; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ Digikam"

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gwenview"
msgstr "Gwenview"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another advanced image viewer which can load and save all image formats "
"supported by &kde;, as well as being able to display the <application>"
"GIMP</application> (*.<acronym>xcf</acronym>) image filetype. <application>"
"Gwenview</application> can perform a few graphical manipulations (rotate, "
"mirroring) and has full support for KIO slaves (allowing you to use it via "
"&FTP;). Other features also include file management operations, such as copy, "
"paste, move and delete."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/\">"
"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/\">"
"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>Gwenview</application> Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ <application>Gwenview</application>"

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "ShowImg"
msgstr "ShowImg"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A feature-rich image viewer, written for &kde;, which can display numerous "
"formats, including <acronym>JPEG</acronym>, <acronym>PNG</acronym>"
", [animated] <acronym>GIF</acronym> and <acronym>MNG</acronym>"
". It consists of a tree-view frame, a directory/preview frame, and a view "
"frame. The (larger) view frame can be exchanged with the (smaller) "
"directory/preview frame. It can preview and display images from multiple "
"directories and search for identical images. <application>ShowImg</application> "
"also features a full-screen mode, zooming, sorting, drag and drop with "
"&konqueror;, and support for images in compressed archives."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/\">"
"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/\">"
"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>ShowImg</application> Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ <application>ShowImg</application>"

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "KimDaBa"
msgstr "KimDaBa"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>KimDaBa</application> (&kde; Image Database) attempts to provide "
"an efficient solution for the organization of hundreds (or even thousands) of "
"images. Having been highly optimized for annotating images, <application>"
"KimDaBa</application> can help you locate an image in a matter of seconds."
msgstr "<application>KimDaBa</application> (មូលដ្ឋាន​ទិន្នន័យ KDE) ព្យាយាម​ដើម្បី​ផ្"
"ដល់​ដំណោះ​ស្រាយ​មាន​ប្រយោជន៍​សម្រាប់​ការ​រៀបចំ​នៃ​រូបភាព​រាប់រយ (ឬ​រាប់ពាន់)"
""
" ។ បាន​ត្រូវ​ប្ដូរ​តាម​បំណង​យ៉ាង​ខ្ពស់​សម្រាប់​ចារ​សេចក្ដី​ពន្យល់​រូបភាព "
"<application>KimDaBa</application> "
"អាច​ជួយ​អ្នក​ដាក់​ទីតាំង​រូបភាព​ក្នុង​តែ​ប៉ុន្មាន​វិនាទី ។"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://ktown.kde.org/kimdaba/\">"
"http://ktown.kde.org/kimdaba/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://ktown.kde.org/kimdaba/\">"
"http://ktown.kde.org/kimdaba/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>KimDaBa</application> Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ <application>KimDaBa</application>"

#. Tag: title
#: extragear-applications.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network"
msgstr "បណ្ដាញ"

#. Tag: term
#: extragear-applications.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konversation;"
msgstr "Konversation"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A fully-featured <acronym>IRC</acronym> client which supports per channel "
"encoding, downloading and resuming file transfers, nick completion and "
"highlighting, as well as tight integration with &kontact; and the rest of "
"&kde;."
msgstr "ម៉ាស៊ីន​ភ្ញៀវ <acronym>IRC</acronym> "
"ដែល​មាន​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ពេញ​លេញ​ដែល​គាំទ្រ​ក្នុង​ការ​អ៊ីនកូដ​ឆានែល ទាញយក "
"និង​បន្ត​ការ​ផ្ទេរ​ឯកសារ ការ​បំពេញ​សម្មិតិនាម "
"រួម​ទាំង​ការ​បញ្ចូល​យ៉ាង​តឹង​ជាមួយ Kontact និង​ទាំងអស់​នៃ Kde ។"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://konversation.kde.org\">"
"http://konversation.kde.org</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://konversation.kde.org\">"
"http://konversation.kde.org</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konversation; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ Konversation"

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "KMldonkey"
msgstr "KMldonkey"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A &kde; frontend for <application>MLDonkey</application>, a powerful <acronym>"
"P2P</acronym> file-sharing tool. Highly configurable, real-time graphical "
"bandwidth and network statistics, and much more."
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​មុខ​ក្រោយ KDE សម្រាប់ <application>MLDonkey</application> "
"ឧបករណ៍​ចែក​រំលែក​ឯកសារ <acronym>P2P</acronym> មាន​អនុភាព ។ "
"កម្រិត​បញ្ជូន​ក្រាហ្វិក​ពេល​វេលា​ពិត អាច​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​ខ្ពស់ "
"និង​ស្ថិតិ​បណ្ដាញ និង​ច្រើន​ទៀត ។"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Website: <ulink url=\"http://kmldonkey.org/\">http://kmldonkey.org/</ulink>"
msgstr "តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://kmldonkey.org/\">http://kmldonkey.org/</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>KMldonkey</application> Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ <application>KMldonkey</application>"

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "KNemo"
msgstr "KNemo"

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Displays for every network interface an icon in the systray. Tooltips and an "
"info dialog provide further information about the interface. Passive popups "
"inform about interface changes and a traffic plotter is also integrated."
msgstr "បង្ហាញ​សម្រាប់​គ្រប់​ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់​បណ្ដាញ​នូវ​រូប​តំណាង​ក្នុង​ថាស​ប្រព័ន្ធ ។"
" ព័ត៌មាន​ជំនួយ និង​ប្រអប់​ព័ត៌មាន​ផ្ដល់​ព័ត៌មាន​បន្ថែម​អំពី​ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់ ។ "
""
"ការ​លេចឡើង​អកម្ម​ជូន​ដំណឹង​អំពី​ការ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ចំនុច​ប្រទាក់ និង a traffic "
"plotter is also integrated ។"

